{"question": "kg-decision-llm", "strategy": "graph", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "effort": null, "answer": {"answer": "No. kg never calls an LLM itself and needs no API keys (decision:no-embedded-llm, RF-24: 'kg never calls an LLM nor needs API keys; external agents do the reading and send JSON'). External agents such as Claude Code read the documents and decisions. They follow the guide that kg ships for them (package kg.agents, 'Guidelines for external agents that enrich the graph (RF-20)', printed by `kg guide` via kg.agents.load_guide). They write a JSON document that is valid against the schema and has llm provenance, then merge it into the store with `kg add` (kg.merge.add_to_store: 'Validate a JSON document and merge it into the store'). The merge goes by ID (concept:merge-by-id), and parser provenance wins over llm provenance, so enrichment cannot wipe deterministic data (decision:parser-wins-over-llm). The decision nodes in this graph do carry provenance method 'llm' with extractor 'claude-code', which shows an external agent added them.", "items": [], "evidence": ["decision:no-embedded-llm", "decision:no-embedded-llm -[justifies]-> package:kg", "package:kg.agents", "function:kg.agents.load_guide", "function:kg.cli._guide", "function:kg.merge.add_to_store", "function:kg.cli._add", "concept:merge-by-id", "function:kg.merge.merge_document -[implements]-> concept:merge-by-id", "decision:parser-wins-over-llm -[justifies]-> module:kg.merge", "test:tests.test_guide.test_guide_example_is_valid_and_uses_llm_provenance", "provenance of decision:no-embedded-llm: method=llm, extractor=claude-code, source=docs/requirements.md"]}, "outcome": "answered", "turns": 15, "tool_calls": 14, "tool_errors": 0, "seconds": 62.55, "usage": {"total_tokens": 41253}, "repo": "kg", "topic": "decisions", "grade": {"score": 1.0, "precision": null, "recall": null, "missing": [], "extra": []}, "traceability": 0.9167, "calls": ["kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "submit_answer"], "config": {"runner": "subagent", "max_turns": 25, "strategies": ["graph"], "questions": "bench/questions/main.json", "repos": {"basic-python-cli": "d0379bb", "kg": "1a342c4", "my_first_data_project": "3d57177", "python-clean-architecture": "6f58de5"}, "kg": "kg 0.1.0.dev0", "kg_commit": "bf68b28"}}
